The scanner imports addon-declare, the public checker
(https://github.com/bcrypto0/addon-declaration), by path at run time. Its code
is not copied into this repository; it is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 by the addon-declaration authors.

The text of the publishers page (build/core.js, publishersPage) is adapted
from the README of addon-declaration (https://github.com/bcrypto0/addon-declaration),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 by the addon-declaration authors.

The files in data/ hold results of checks and text read from other parties.
Listing names, titles, descriptions and URLs come from the public API of the
official MCP Registry; declarations and key records come from publishers'
domains. That text belongs to its publishers and is reproduced as read,
cleaned and shortened, for reference.
